{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An army of monsters stands between you and victory, can you survive the mayhem?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monster Mayhem</i> is a fast-paced rogue-like action game where you face challenging levels filled with relentless waves of monsters and epic boss battles. Unlock new stages by conquering the previous ones, master unique heroes, and sharpen your strategy as the difficulty increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with Tower Defense Mode (Update 1.1.0)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend or die! A massive new Tower Defense mode has arrived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy powerful towers across strategic battlefields as waves of increasingly dangerous enemies assault your base. Master the perfect defense with four unique tower types, each with devastating special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades through the new Skill Tree system, allowing you to customize your defensive strategy to match your playstyle. Construct towers with resources earned from defeating enemies, but spend wisely, your survival depends on it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level-Based Progression</strong> \u2013 Each level increases in difficulty. Defeat the final wave and Boss to unlock the next stage and face greater challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/23063fa651f9d00d64d46e84b09598de.poster.avif?t=1761648969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/23063fa651f9d00d64d46e84b09598de.webm?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/23063fa651f9d00d64d46e84b09598de.mp4?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Heroes</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade a roster of powerful characters, each with different stats and starting ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/a61632feb1857da0b9dd9d784972af2a.poster.avif?t=1761648969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/a61632feb1857da0b9dd9d784972af2a.webm?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/a61632feb1857da0b9dd9d784972af2a.mp4?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong> \u2013 Battle through icy peaks, scorching deserts, and more, each with unique enemies and hazards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/594337c24b19f9e38f7751523d9e0bcf.poster.avif?t=1761648969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/594337c24b19f9e38f7751523d9e0bcf.webm?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/594337c24b19f9e38f7751523d9e0bcf.mp4?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Unlock powerful upgrades to enhance your gameplay! Discover the rare <strong>Revive</strong> ability, allowing you to come back from death once per run. Unleash the <strong>Minion</strong> upgrade to summon up to <strong>10 loyal minions</strong> to fight alongside you in battle. And that\u2019s just the beginning \u2014 explore a wide range of upgrades to become unstoppable!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/e740b2a5ef253f128873cf691f0f6c4b.poster.avif?t=1761648969\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/e740b2a5ef253f128873cf691f0f6c4b.webm?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585220/extras/e740b2a5ef253f128873cf691f0f6c4b.mp4?t=1761648969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against monstrous bosses that require strategy and skill to defeat. Learn their patterns, dodge deadly attacks, and deliver the final blow, master a wide variety of <strong>active and passive abilities</strong>, and uncover <strong>even more surprises</strong> as you progress through the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience by choosing your favorite soundtrack from a variety of <strong>music genres</strong>. Whether you prefer epic orchestral scores, intense rock tracks, or EDM tunes, you can set the mood that suits your playstyle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you conquer every stage and defeat every boss, or will you be overrun by the horde?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is only the beginning!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlock all upgrades","path":"https://cdn.